opam-version: "2.0"
version: "2.2.2+dio1"
synopsis: "A portable network connection establishment library for Lwt_unix (OxCaml-patched)"
description: """
Patched to expose `default_ctx : ctx Lazy.t` (upstream 2.2.2 exposes `ctx`),
matching the API of later Conduit releases so the engine source compiles
unchanged on both toolchains. Only the type of `default_ctx` changes; the
context value is identical.
"""
